===Costa Rica vs Brazil===
The opening goal for Brazil, a shot from [[Ronaldo (Brazilian footballer)|Ronaldo]] that deflected off Costa Rica's [[Luis Marín (footballer, born 1974)|Luis Marín]], was initially ruled as an own goal. However, after a protest by Ronaldo, FIFA's technical study group credited him with the goal instead.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport3/worldcup2002/hi/team_pages/brazil/newsid_2044000/2044349.stm |title=Ronaldo wins goal protest |publisher=[[BBC Sport]] |date=14 June 2002 |access-date=2 May 2026}}</ref>

